{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Keep remote exports out of checkpoint callbacks**\n\n`onOperationChange` runs while checkpoint processing holds its polling lock and before poller futures complete. Synchronous S3/CloudWatch export and flush here can stall durable progress for network latency or timeouts. Queue/coalesce immutable snapshots here and drain them from awaited `onInvocationEnd`; add a delayed-exporter coordination test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sv47X","finding_digest":"bc70e659378e613de7bdb3b2633e5192cc833438fddfe77f4a591b9e4288a471","finding_id":"arf_v1_xryomwjxrzqt3z55wozggpsrsl","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.emit::checkpoint-hook-blocking","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.emit::checkpoint-hook-blocking","line":151,"observation_digest":"8e33c8b20d9f542d6677363f21c96c0ea565d9b7b8e05074b71c381f5d11b0f1","observation_id":"aro_v1_ryz4rmqnt5kc2ztxgy7sdslmb2","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_xryomwjxrzqt3z55wozggpsrsl","published_at":"2026-09-09T18:57:09Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gaza4v2hy7owxqmfaj7d3xtx4q","reviewed_base_sha":"686c447b61d148228285e1d3e9c07d0b3b0358b1","reviewed_head_sha":"661ff218518770f142c359f81bc08e3d93bc5a7d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":151,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_55n5maiw5lo6lcvo2tstad7yqj","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T18:57:09Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
